From c9b5342cc683e0e30ea627681bdf0c30dbd17f30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:29:30 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Wi-Fi: retry joining a network, /proc/dswifistat, WPA marked

- ARM7 wifi_join_tick() (vblank): while a network is chosen but not joined
  and no scan runs, resend the authentication (or association) every
  second; the original code sent one frame and never retried.
- Join counters (auth/assoc frames, last status codes, channels) in four new
  stats words; /proc/dswifistat prints them and the state flags.
- /proc/dswifi marks WPA networks "wpa".
- Wi-Fi window: key before ESSID, waits up to 12 s for the join showing
  the tries, explains a failure, refuses WPA; logs to /tmp/dsnet.log.
- logbody: /proc/dswifistat, dsnet.log, the DHCP output.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
